<!--
  Wazuh RMM Abuse Detection Pack - APPROVED TOOLS (allowlist)

  If your organisation officially uses an RMM tool, approve it here so normal
  IT work does not raise "tool started" or "DNS lookup" alerts for it.

  HOW TO APPROVE A TOOL
    1. Find the tool below. Each one is wrapped in a comment block.
    2. Delete the comment start line above the rule and the comment end line below it.
    3. Check syntax:   sudo /var/ossec/bin/wazuh-analysisd -t
    4. Apply:          sudo systemctl restart wazuh-manager

  WHAT STAYS ON EVEN FOR APPROVED TOOLS (on purpose)
    Renamed binaries (100900), a tool launching a shell (100901) and runs from
    Downloads/Temp/Desktop (100971) are attacker behaviour even with an approved tool.
-->

